WEBVTT

00:00:04.491 --> 00:00:08.495
Dig! Dig! Dig! Dig! Dig! Dig! Dig! Dig!

00:00:08.495 --> 00:00:10.247
Wow! Amazing!

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:12.666
This is nothing. A piece of cake!

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:14.709
Do it more!

00:00:14.709 --> 00:00:16.753
Do it more! Do it more!

00:00:16.753 --> 00:00:18.505
I'm back.

00:00:19.214 --> 00:00:21.299
You went to the other side of the wall again?

00:00:21.299 --> 00:00:23.218
Please take a look at this.

00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:28.473
A piggy!

00:00:34.855 --> 00:00:39.651
I'm glad you feel better.
Now, grow to be delicious!

00:00:39.651 --> 00:00:43.196
Yeah… But don’t really eat him, okay?

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:44.489
Why not?

00:00:44.489 --> 00:00:49.244
Since olden times, it’s been
said that we have to respect pigs.

00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:50.787
Why?

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:55.041
I-I'm not totally sure but
you’ll pay for it if you don’t.

00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:58.253
I'm not totally sure,
but we have to respect them.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:02.007
I'm not totally sure,
but we have to respect them.

00:01:04.509 --> 00:01:05.969
Hey, feed me.

00:01:05.969 --> 00:01:07.512
He talked?!

00:01:07.512 --> 00:01:08.346
He’s a pig, so, yeah…

00:01:08.513 --> 00:01:09.347
He’s a pig, so, yeah…

00:01:09.431 --> 00:01:10.682
He’s a pig, so, yeah…

00:01:11.099 --> 00:01:12.726
Oh, I didn’t know!

00:01:12.726 --> 00:01:15.020
So, Mr. Piggy, what’s your name?

00:01:17.522 --> 00:01:18.982
I am Honorable Oda, oink.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:46.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:51.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:57.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.480
We don't need no reasons

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:07.570
To change for the better

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:14.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:16.960
You're a shooting star

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:20.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:25.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.550
Light on the shooting star

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:33.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.680
Let's go in search of it

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:41.440
Fly away

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:04.079
Come one, come all!

00:03:04.079 --> 00:03:05.872
If you don’t, you’ll miss something real good!

00:03:05.872 --> 00:03:09.918
Take a look at this cane! If I cast a spell…

00:03:09.918 --> 00:03:12.003
Yade-yada-yada…

00:03:12.003 --> 00:03:13.296
There!

00:03:14.422 --> 00:03:20.553
--La-la-la-la-la. La-la-la-la-la.

00:03:20.553 --> 00:03:22.305
Wow! That’s amazing!

00:03:22.305 --> 00:03:24.432
Give him a hand!

00:03:26.434 --> 00:03:27.435
Tada!

00:03:27.978 --> 00:03:30.272
You’re as amazing as ever, Boyayan!

00:03:30.272 --> 00:03:31.773
Yes!

00:03:31.773 --> 00:03:33.817
It’s a simple trick.

00:03:33.817 --> 00:03:37.112
Now, if you buy this magical cane right now,

00:03:37.112 --> 00:03:38.863
it’s only 100,000 yen!

00:03:38.863 --> 00:03:42.325
No pushing, please! We’ve got enough in stock!

00:03:43.201 --> 00:03:44.661
Oh dear…

00:03:44.744 --> 00:03:46.621
You damned fools!

00:03:46.621 --> 00:03:48.790
We have to make money, guys!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.292
We’re broke!

00:03:50.292 --> 00:03:51.876
Well, it’s easy for you to say that, but...

00:03:51.876 --> 00:03:53.962
We’re working hard, you know.

00:03:53.962 --> 00:03:55.380
Shut up!

00:03:56.631 --> 00:03:57.590
Geez…

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.175
Hey, you guys!

00:03:59.801 --> 00:04:01.511
Over here!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.222
What’re they doing?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.476
How cute! I'd expect no less from you, Gatchan!

00:04:08.476 --> 00:04:10.061
G-Gatchan?

00:04:10.061 --> 00:04:11.313
Impressive, Gatchan.

00:04:11.396 --> 00:04:13.440
Impressive, Gatchan.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.150
She was having trouble, so…

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:19.487
I'm not good at sewing…
I'm good at pricking, though.

00:04:19.654 --> 00:04:21.614
That sounds like a bee.

00:04:21.614 --> 00:04:25.368
Mitchan is all thumbs,
so it really was a great help.

00:04:25.368 --> 00:04:27.662
And, sorry, this is all we can do to thank you.

00:04:27.662 --> 00:04:28.997
Whoa!

00:04:28.997 --> 00:04:30.373
It’s dumpling soup!

00:04:30.373 --> 00:04:32.208
Thank you, Gatchan!

00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:33.209
Sure.

00:04:34.294 --> 00:04:38.465
Th-There are so many ingredients that
the chopsticks can stand up!

00:04:38.465 --> 00:04:40.467
I'm gonna have some now!

00:04:41.426 --> 00:04:44.763
Yummy! Alouette, open wide!

00:04:45.847 --> 00:04:49.267
This is good!

00:04:50.685 --> 00:04:51.686
This is delicious!

00:04:52.312 --> 00:04:54.606
Eat a lot and grow big quickly!

00:04:59.069 --> 00:05:01.071
Thank you for the soup!

00:05:01.071 --> 00:05:02.822
Glad you liked it.

00:05:02.822 --> 00:05:05.909
We’ve been having poor
crop yields lately in this area, too.

00:05:05.909 --> 00:05:10.705
On top of that, our sales tax was
raised to 80%. We keep being exploited.

00:05:10.705 --> 00:05:11.873
Mitchan!

00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:16.169
N… Never mind.

00:05:20.131 --> 00:05:22.884
So, Yatterman is the only one who’s happy!

00:05:24.886 --> 00:05:27.472
Say, I've been thinking
about this for a while now, but…

00:05:28.556 --> 00:05:30.433
…if we don’t have anything to eat, then…

00:05:31.768 --> 00:05:32.727
No, we can’t do that!

00:05:32.727 --> 00:05:33.728
She’s right!

00:05:33.728 --> 00:05:34.938
It’s too soon!

00:05:34.938 --> 00:05:35.397
Huh?

00:05:35.397 --> 00:05:38.900
Ah… We have to respect pigs!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:39.734
Why?

00:05:39.734 --> 00:05:44.155
It’s been said since olden times
that we have to respect pigs!

00:05:44.155 --> 00:05:47.033
That must mean we should
eat them with respect.

00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:47.951
Yep!

00:05:48.493 --> 00:05:50.912
How kind you are, my angel!

00:05:51.746 --> 00:05:54.290
No, that wasn’t what I meant!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.753
This pig, Honorable Oda, has quite an attitude.

00:05:58.753 --> 00:06:01.172
He must’ve been raised spoiled.

00:06:02.757 --> 00:06:07.137
Say, I'm going to go
collect firewood. If you like…

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.602
Thanks for bringing us with you.

00:06:14.602 --> 00:06:15.603
No problem.

00:06:15.603 --> 00:06:17.814
Oh, I see.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.317
Where’s my angel?

00:06:21.317 --> 00:06:24.070
H-Hey… Geez…

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.990
I heard that you and your friends are traveling?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.994
Y-Yeah, we’re going to
see Alouette’s mom and dad.

00:06:30.994 --> 00:06:32.787
My dog is waiting, too.

00:06:32.787 --> 00:06:35.623
Hm? You don’t like dogs?

00:06:35.623 --> 00:06:36.374
Hm?

00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:38.460
If I remember correctly,

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:42.172
"Doronjo" is also the name of
a master thief in a folktale, isn’t it?

00:06:44.466 --> 00:06:47.427
Really? ls that right?

00:06:48.761 --> 00:06:52.140
Hey, is that a boy? Or a girl?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.685
It’s probably a boy. He’s very lively.

00:06:55.685 --> 00:06:57.312
Ah, he kicked again.

00:06:57.312 --> 00:06:58.813
Can I touch it?

00:06:58.813 --> 00:07:00.106
Sure.

00:07:00.106 --> 00:07:04.652
I’ll work hard together
with my husband for this baby.

00:07:04.652 --> 00:07:09.240
Come into the world healthy,
okay, Mitchan’s angel?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.158
If I were a monkey,

00:07:10.158 --> 00:07:13.119
I would’ve been able to bathe in
an outdoor hot spring with Miss Alouette…

00:07:13.119 --> 00:07:15.121
I envy monkeys.

00:07:16.331 --> 00:07:18.333
I wanna become a monkey.

00:07:19.083 --> 00:07:20.251
I do, too.

00:07:20.251 --> 00:07:22.170
What? Hey…

00:07:26.883 --> 00:07:30.386
We're not trying to peep at Miss Alouette here.

00:07:30.386 --> 00:07:32.680
That’s right. We’re guarding her.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.433
I-It can’t be helped if it’s
guard duty, right…? Yeah…

00:07:49.489 --> 00:07:54.869
You… damned fools!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.540
Gatchan! Peeping is wrong! Don’t ever do it!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.791
She’s right!

00:07:59.791 --> 00:08:02.001
You’re not in a position to say that!

00:08:02.001 --> 00:08:05.922
l understand why you did it
since she’s so cute, but it’s wrong.

00:08:05.922 --> 00:08:06.965
Yes, ma’am.

00:08:08.883 --> 00:08:10.093
Honorable Oda?!

00:08:10.093 --> 00:08:12.512
They’re here, oink.

00:08:14.556 --> 00:08:16.766
Come closer, you vermin!

00:08:16.766 --> 00:08:18.726
I wonder what they’re doing.

00:08:18.726 --> 00:08:20.937
Honey… Honey!

00:08:22.021 --> 00:08:23.898
We’ll go around from that side!

00:08:23.898 --> 00:08:25.608
Are we going on a raid?

00:08:27.068 --> 00:08:29.195
U-Uhm, may I help you?

00:08:29.195 --> 00:08:30.405
Yatterman!

00:08:30.405 --> 00:08:32.156
Y-Yatterman!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.578
That’s…!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.079
You are hereby ordered

00:08:38.121 --> 00:08:42.542
to do thirty-five years of
heavy labor in Yatter Metropolis!

00:08:43.209 --> 00:08:44.586
Wha…?!

00:08:47.171 --> 00:08:49.299
Thirty-five years?!

00:08:49.382 --> 00:08:55.305
This summons is effective as of now!
You’ll leave right away!

00:08:55.305 --> 00:08:59.142
O-Oh no… P-Please wait
at least until tomorrow!

00:08:59.142 --> 00:09:00.518
Line up!

00:09:01.227 --> 00:09:03.688
Salute! Yatterman!

00:09:06.733 --> 00:09:12.822
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:09:09.764 --> 00:09:16.222
It's an honor to be able to work for Lord Yatterman! Congratulations!

00:09:12.822 --> 00:09:21.623
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:09:16.723 --> 00:09:21.523
--Honey…

00:09:21.623 --> 00:09:27.629
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:09:27.629 --> 00:09:36.971
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:09:27.629 --> 00:09:33.471
--Th-Thank you very much everyone. I feel… honored.

00:09:33.471 --> 00:09:36.971
--I'll go work hard for Lord Yatterman.

00:09:36.971 --> 00:09:38.848
We’re off!

00:09:38.848 --> 00:09:44.395
-- Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:09:44.395 --> 00:09:50.777
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatter…!
--Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah…!

00:09:57.158 --> 00:09:59.285
It’s an honor?! Don’t make me laugh!

00:09:59.285 --> 00:10:04.248
This country --Yatter Kingdom--
is no heaven after all!

00:10:04.248 --> 00:10:06.376
To think that they make their people cry…!

00:10:06.376 --> 00:10:11.756
My mom and dad were
taken away like that, too. And…

00:10:12.674 --> 00:10:14.133
I've decided.

00:10:14.467 --> 00:10:15.426
Miss Doronjo…?

00:10:15.426 --> 00:10:17.011
Don’t tell me…

00:10:17.011 --> 00:10:21.683
I feel sorry for Mitchan!
She’s having a baby, and yet…

00:10:21.683 --> 00:10:24.769
They said thirty-five years! Thirty-five years!

00:10:24.769 --> 00:10:26.979
But even if we’re able to take him back,

00:10:26.979 --> 00:10:30.066
there’s no place to escape to in Yatter Kingdom.

00:10:30.066 --> 00:10:32.443
If they find him, that’ll be the end for him.

00:10:32.443 --> 00:10:34.904
It’d only be a temporary solution.

00:10:35.947 --> 00:10:38.616
We can take him to our house.

00:10:38.616 --> 00:10:40.576
Even Yatter Soldiers won’t follow him that far!

00:10:40.576 --> 00:10:41.327
But…

00:10:41.327 --> 00:10:44.872
Shut up! Are you with me or not?!

00:10:44.872 --> 00:10:47.208
I’ll do it even if I have to do it by myself!

00:10:47.208 --> 00:10:50.169
We will always follow you, Miss Doronjo.

00:10:50.169 --> 00:10:51.462
We’re with you.

00:10:51.462 --> 00:10:53.214
Good. What about you, Galina?

00:10:53.214 --> 00:10:55.466
What?! Uhm…

00:11:01.389 --> 00:11:03.933
O-Okay! Then…

00:11:03.933 --> 00:11:04.892
Good!

00:11:05.643 --> 00:11:07.061
It’s decided then!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.524
We’ll take a thirty-minute break!

00:11:16.195 --> 00:11:17.405
What’s this?

00:11:17.405 --> 00:11:18.656
What’s the matter?

00:11:22.076 --> 00:11:23.494
What the heck is this?

00:11:24.537 --> 00:11:26.581
Your guard is down!

00:11:26.998 --> 00:11:28.624
You are…!

00:11:30.585 --> 00:11:33.588
Be pure! Be right! Be beautiful!

00:11:33.588 --> 00:11:35.798
As long as Doronbow exists,

00:11:35.798 --> 00:11:38.885
Yatterman will have no place in this world!

00:11:38.885 --> 00:11:43.973
We’ll drive the darkness away
and bring a new dawn to this world!

00:11:45.308 --> 00:11:48.269
That’s Doronjo from the report…!

00:11:49.687 --> 00:11:52.648
Now, run while you can!

00:11:53.274 --> 00:11:56.486
Get moving! Hurry up!

00:11:56.486 --> 00:11:58.654
You guys, too! Hurry up and run!

00:12:08.956 --> 00:12:11.584
Please watch your step.

00:12:11.584 --> 00:12:14.795
Hey, why on earth are you
bringing me to a place like this?

00:12:14.795 --> 00:12:15.796
That’s…

00:12:15.796 --> 00:12:16.964
Mitchan!

00:12:19.717 --> 00:12:20.759
Honey!

00:12:21.177 --> 00:12:23.053
Good! Let’s go!

00:12:23.053 --> 00:12:24.138
"Let’s go"?

00:12:24.138 --> 00:12:25.014
Go where?

00:12:25.014 --> 00:12:28.767
We’ll help you escape to a place that
is beyond Yatterman’s reach without fail!

00:12:30.269 --> 00:12:32.646
Doronjo, that outfit…

00:12:32.646 --> 00:12:35.483
You really look like
that legendary master thief.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:41.655
That’s right! I'm Yatterman’s enemy… Doronjo!

00:12:49.246 --> 00:12:51.916
So, you’re sure that it was them?

00:12:51.916 --> 00:12:54.001
Yes, sir! There’s no doubt about it!

00:12:54.668 --> 00:12:57.171
What perfect prey!

00:12:57.546 --> 00:13:00.883
We’ll hunt and punish the rebels!

00:13:00.883 --> 00:13:02.635
Yatterman!

00:13:04.053 --> 00:13:07.848
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter…!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.852
We’ll hunt them!

00:13:18.526 --> 00:13:20.861
Here? Okay, then!

00:13:20.861 --> 00:13:23.906
Here’s the Mecha Tonic! Yatterpug!

00:13:35.793 --> 00:13:40.089
Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose.
Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose.

00:13:40.089 --> 00:13:42.049
--Go after them!
--Nose. Nose. Nose.

00:13:42.049 --> 00:13:45.719
Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose.

00:13:45.719 --> 00:13:47.721
Nose. Nose. Nose…

00:13:51.058 --> 00:13:52.977
To the fools who call themselves

00:13:52.977 --> 00:13:55.980
the legendary thieves, Doronjo and her men!

00:13:56.897 --> 00:14:01.694
You’re up against Lord Yatterman,
so there’s no place for you to escape!

00:14:01.694 --> 00:14:03.904
Surrender immediately!

00:14:03.904 --> 00:14:06.156
Or in the name of Lord Yatterman,

00:14:06.156 --> 00:14:09.285
--Now, hurry!
--I, General Gore, will punish you mercilessly!

00:14:09.285 --> 00:14:11.245
I’ll help you escape for sure!

00:14:19.295 --> 00:14:20.713
Are you okay?

00:14:20.713 --> 00:14:23.340
Yeah… I'm just a little tired.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.594
l see… At any rate, this isn’t gonna work.

00:14:26.594 --> 00:14:28.596
We can’t escape from Yatterman.

00:14:28.596 --> 00:14:33.100
But if we let them
take you to Yatter Metropolis,

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.020
we’ll be apart for thirty-five years.

00:14:37.438 --> 00:14:40.524
We may not be able to see each other again…

00:14:40.524 --> 00:14:41.900
If that’s the case…

00:14:43.193 --> 00:14:44.612
Honey?

00:14:44.778 --> 00:14:47.990
Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose…

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.575
Nose. Nose. Nose.

00:14:50.784 --> 00:14:53.829
T-Take me to the person in charge!

00:14:55.122 --> 00:14:59.001
l see… So, you’re saying
that there are also a boy and a girl

00:14:59.001 --> 00:15:03.130
besides those who call themselves
Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:08.552
And, you and your wife
were taken by them by force?

00:15:08.552 --> 00:15:13.390
Y-Yes. And, uhm…
I'd like to request something.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.767
What is it?

00:15:15.559 --> 00:15:19.688
I-I'll tell you where they are. I-In return,
I'd like to ask you to excuse me

00:15:19.688 --> 00:15:23.859
from the heavy labor in Yatter Metropolis.

00:15:23.859 --> 00:15:24.777
Oh?

00:15:24.777 --> 00:15:31.033
M-My wife is pregnant,
so I'd like to be by her side!

00:15:31.033 --> 00:15:34.787
Okay. I’ll grant your request.

00:15:35.037 --> 00:15:37.873
Thank you very much! Thank you very much!

00:15:37.873 --> 00:15:38.916
Well?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.002
Where are they?

00:15:52.179 --> 00:15:53.681
I'm sorry.

00:15:56.725 --> 00:15:57.976
Let’s go.

00:16:01.021 --> 00:16:03.399
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:06.276 --> 00:16:08.362
Rebels!

00:16:11.073 --> 00:16:15.452
O-Oh no! W… We’re surrounded!

00:16:18.163 --> 00:16:22.167
So, that’s the girl who calls
herself Doronjo and her gang, huh?

00:16:22.376 --> 00:16:24.545
They seem like an easy opponent.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.214
I am General Goro!

00:16:27.214 --> 00:16:32.052
Rebels! We’ll now start your punishment!

00:16:32.052 --> 00:16:33.345
Yatterman!

00:16:34.054 --> 00:16:35.431
Yatterman!

00:16:35.931 --> 00:16:37.725
Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose…

00:16:37.808 --> 00:16:39.560
Here they come!

00:16:40.436 --> 00:16:42.146
I’ll take care of them!

00:16:46.316 --> 00:16:48.444
Oh, stop crying, you damned fool!

00:16:48.444 --> 00:16:52.197
Leave it to me! I thought something
like this might happen, so…

00:16:58.662 --> 00:17:02.499
There’s a lot that wanna say,
but for now, just get in!

00:17:04.418 --> 00:17:06.378
Monkey!

00:17:07.045 --> 00:17:09.965
Ha! That’s just useless resistance!

00:17:10.007 --> 00:17:11.884
Give them hell!

00:17:12.176 --> 00:17:17.765
l built this monkey to express
our strong desire to be monkeys.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.767
Huh?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:27.816
A cool man leaves quietly without looking
back at the past or monkeying around.

00:17:35.783 --> 00:17:36.950
Here they come!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.327
And, <i>click.</i>

00:17:39.244 --> 00:17:41.038
Bee! Bee! Bee…!

00:17:41.038 --> 00:17:41.747
Nose!

00:17:41.747 --> 00:17:42.915
Bee!

00:17:42.915 --> 00:17:49.671
--Nose. Nose. Nose. Nose…
--Bee. Bee. Bee. Bee…

00:17:49.922 --> 00:17:51.965
Here I come!

00:18:13.445 --> 00:18:15.155
Not bad.

00:18:24.248 --> 00:18:27.918
You dummy! Stop moving around!

00:18:48.522 --> 00:18:49.940
This is it for you!

00:19:01.285 --> 00:19:05.289
What’s taking so long?
It’s about time to finish them off.

00:19:05.289 --> 00:19:05.372
What’s takin so long?
It’s about time finish them off.

00:19:23.682 --> 00:19:25.225
It’s over.

00:19:25.475 --> 00:19:29.897
This is how fools who go
against Lord Yatterman end up.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.941
E-Excuse me…

00:19:32.941 --> 00:19:37.487
We were able to get rid of the
rebels thanks to you. I appreciate it.

00:19:37.487 --> 00:19:40.741
Th-Then, you’ll let me…

00:19:40.741 --> 00:19:41.992
Take him.

00:19:42.326 --> 00:19:44.912
Th-That’s not what you promised!

00:19:44.912 --> 00:19:45.871
Honey!

00:19:45.871 --> 00:19:47.623
Promise?

00:19:48.665 --> 00:19:52.502
You’ll be able to work for Lord Yatterman.

00:19:52.502 --> 00:19:55.881
l expect you to feel honored!

00:19:56.089 --> 00:19:59.384
You think so, too, don’t you, missus?

00:19:59.384 --> 00:20:00.469
That’s…

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:05.599
Don’t… you?

00:20:05.891 --> 00:20:07.935
Y-Yes sir.

00:20:09.019 --> 00:20:10.812
We’re off!

00:20:10.812 --> 00:20:14.441
Yatterman!

00:20:15.609 --> 00:20:17.611
Mitchan! Mitchan!

00:20:18.111 --> 00:20:21.156
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter…!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.327
H-Hurrah…

00:20:26.161 --> 00:20:27.287
Hurrah!

00:20:29.373 --> 00:20:30.624
Hurrah!

00:20:30.999 --> 00:20:32.209
Hurrah!

00:20:32.459 --> 00:20:33.877
Hurrah!

00:20:40.509 --> 00:20:43.136
I thought we were going to die.

00:20:44.721 --> 00:20:45.847
Mitchan!

00:20:45.973 --> 00:20:47.307
Stay away!

00:20:48.809 --> 00:20:50.811
Leave me alone.

00:20:53.188 --> 00:20:57.734
I-If they find out that I had anything to
do with Lord Yatterman’s enemy…

00:20:57.734 --> 00:20:58.944
W-Wait!

00:20:58.944 --> 00:21:01.238
Hurrah for Lord Yatterman!

00:21:01.738 --> 00:21:04.074
Hurrah for Lord Yatterman!

00:21:04.574 --> 00:21:16.837
Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.945
I-Is it really okay?

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:16.537
It's perfectly clear to me now that this place...

00:21:16.837 --> 00:21:18.380
…is hell!

00:21:19.047 --> 00:21:22.884
Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho…

00:21:26.138 --> 00:21:31.226
Both the Great Dokurobey
and my ancestor were right.

00:21:31.226 --> 00:21:35.981
People in Yatter Kingdom are
also suffering because of Yatterman.

00:21:37.691 --> 00:21:41.319
What’s the matter, Doronjo? Are you crying?

00:21:42.446 --> 00:21:44.364
I'm not crying!

00:21:44.364 --> 00:21:48.368
A cool woman always laughs
no matter what situation she’s in!

00:21:55.125 --> 00:21:59.296
I’ll give Yatterman a
forehead flicking for sure…

00:22:04.926 --> 00:22:08.597
…with all my might… Mom…

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:18.090
